'''Pumpking''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2017|2017 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.    
== Appearance ==
Its blade takes a thin, yet long shape with a small indent seen on the fuller near the tip. It is black with orange ancient engravings on it, and its edge is highlighted in orange. The guard takes a unique shape with six flares coming out of an orange demonic pumpkin, encased in a brown prong. The handle, attached to the bottom of the prong, is orange in color with a black paracord design over it.

== Trivia ==
* Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/94794774/Crescendo-The-Soul-Stealer Crescendo, The Soul Stealer]. However, it was retextured by [[Thexz]], altering it from a red color to an orange tint, and replacing the demons eye with an evil looking carved pumpkin face.
* When salvaged, it provides 22 godly [[shards]]. 

